graph TD
    Start[Customer triggers Evaluation] --> FetchProfile[Fetch Customer Monthly Income & Obligations]
    FetchProfile --> Rule1{Rule 1: Income >= ₹15,000?}
    
    Rule1 -- Yes --> Rule2{Rule 2: LTI <= 5.0?}
    Rule1 -- No --> Fail[Mark NOT_ELIGIBLE]
    
    Rule2 -- Yes --> Rule3{Rule 3: DTI <= 0.50?}
    Rule2 -- No --> Fail
    
    Rule3 -- Yes --> Rule4{Rule 4: Tenure 6-60 Months?}
    Rule3 -- No --> Fail
    
    Rule4 -- Yes --> Pass[Mark ELIGIBLE]
    Rule4 -- No --> Fail
    
    Fail --> CalcEMI[Calculate Estimated EMI]
    Pass --> CalcEMI
    
    CalcEMI --> Save[Save EligibilityEvaluation to DB]
    Save --> Return[Return Response to Customer]
